WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.328
P3.2 · Creating a budget from actuals

2
00:00:05.478 --> 00:00:10.009
Creating a budget from actuals gives figures the client recognises.

3
00:00:10.059 --> 00:00:15.008
Then review the largest lines together: revenue, payroll, rent, suppliers.

4
00:00:16.158 --> 00:00:20.640
On the budget page, Seed from Actuals fills every month from the ledger.

5
00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:27.232
Then adjust the lines by driver: revenue, cost of goods sold, personnel, operating expenses.

6
00:00:28.382 --> 00:00:34.216
Linear is the default: steady growth with a seasonal pattern. Flat is a neutral baseline.

7
00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:41.522
YoY needs thirteen months. Holt suits noisy history. AI when the client knows what the history cannot show.

8
00:00:42.972 --> 00:00:46.349
Next: P3.3  Budget versus actuals

